# ==============================================================================
# Git Ignore Rules for Antigravity (Sumaile Project)
# GitHub 100MB単一ファイル制限 & リポジトリ容量適正化
# ==============================================================================

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyc

# Scratch & Temporary test scripts/outputs
scratch/
.tempmediaStorage/
*.tmp
*.bak

# Intermediate restore HTML chunks
ch_*_final.html
chapter_*.html
clean_article_section.html
extracted_*.html
final_article_chunk_*.html
original_clean_view_*.html
perfect_restored_article.html
restored_article_feature.html
full_restored_article_feature.html
section_at_*.html
step_*_dump.txt
line17_dump.txt

# Logs & OS artifacts
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Node & Package Managers
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ==============================================================================
# 大容量バイナリ・参考資料・動画（GitHub 100MB制限対策 & サーバー容量最適化）
# 動画はYouTube埋め込みのみを使用するため、Gitおよび本番サーバーへの動画アップロードは完全禁止
# ==============================================================================
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.flv
*.wmv
test_*.mp3
scratch_*.jpg
scratch_*.txt
screenshot_*.png
public/sample_data/jfd_survey/3D/
public/plans/*.png
public/videos/
backup/
*.patch
public/temp_chunk.js
public/test_syntax*.html

# 大容量参考資料PDF（10MB〜25MB以上の印刷用元データ）
public/data/knowledge/images/*.pdf
data/thermal_knowledge/*.pdf
public/sample_data/**/*.pdf
*.pdf

# 生写真アーカイブ・大容量未圧縮ソース（数GB）
raw_source_cases/
sample_data/
cases_drawings/
*.raw
*.heic
*.tif
*.tiff
